      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"StringBasedR2dbcQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.repository.query\"><code>StringBasedR2dbcQuery</code></a> for the given <code>query</code>, <a href=\"R2dbcQueryMethod.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.repository.query\"><code>R2dbcQueryMethod</code></a>,\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>, and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/ValueExpressionDelegate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ValueExpressionDelegate</code></a>.",
