    {
      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"BindableQuery.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.repository.query\"><code>BindableQuery</code></a> instance using the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/query/ParameterAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>ParameterAccessor</code></a>",
