    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"StringBasedR2dbcQuery.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.repository.query\"><code>StringBasedR2dbcQuery</code></a> expects a query method to be annotated with <a href=\"../Query.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.repository\"><code>Query</code></a> with a SQL query. Supports\nnamed parameters (if enabled on <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>) and SpEL expressions enclosed with <code>:#{…}</code>.",
      "translation": "`StringBasedR2dbcQuery` 期望查询方法使用带有 SQL 查询的 `<code>Query</code>` 注解进行标注。它支持命名参数（如果已在 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/r2dbc/core/DatabaseClient.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.r2dbc.core\"><code>DatabaseClient</code></a>` 上启用）以及用 `<code>:#{…}</code>` 括起来的 SpEL 表达式。",
